      "reason": "Establish closer architectural precedent and identify simple controls that separate lexical matching from the two-witness rule.",
      "query": "FISM FOSSIL content-based sequential recommendation candidate-to-history similarity temporal weighting max pooling multiple historical items corroboration comparison"
    },
